  "label": "User projected onto the man in headscarf as the target of the degrading metaphor",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the man in the headscarf (man_in_headscarf) as the recipient of the degrading label 'dat ass', which is visually mapped onto the sheep butts and then analogically transferred to him. The man's shocked expression and the meme's overall intent reinforce that the user is meant to perceive him as the object of mockery. The distorted text 'ahmarbkrich d' further projects the user's identification with the degrading stereotype being applied to him.",
